<h1>🎮 Open-Source Games — Full Research Report</h1>
<p><b>Research dates:</b> 18–19 October 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>Source:</b> GitHub Search API (300+ license-specific queries) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>Repository:</b> <a href="https://github.com/agentpocket0-gif/Reached">github.com/agentpocket0-gif/Reached</a></p>
<p class="small">यह document 3,995 unique open-source games की पूरी research cover करता है — links, licenses, languages, stars, descriptions, duplicate verification और APK बनाने की पूरी guide।</p>

<h2>1. सारांश (Summary)</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Round</th><th>Native Games (APK-ready)</th><th>Web Games (HTML5)</th><th>कुल</th></tr>
<tr><td>Round 1</td><td>600</td><td>1000</td><td>1600</td></tr>
<tr><td>Round 2</td><td>1638</td><td>757</td><td>2395</td></tr>
<tr><td class="best">कुल</td><td class="best">2238</td><td class="best">1757</td><td class="best">3995</td></tr>
</table>
<p>• हर गेम का repo link, description, language, stars, license और last-updated date है।<br>
• कोई भी repo URL दोबारा नहीं आता (Round 3 verification में 0 exact duplicates confirm हुए)।<br>
• Round 2 में 3D / powerful games (Godot, FPS, voxel, open-world, racing) और नए licenses (zlib, CC0-1.0, CC-BY-4.0, BSD-2-Clause) cover किए गए।</p>

<h2>2. License Cheat-Sheet (कौन सा license क्या छूट देता है)</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>License</th><th>Modify?</th><th>Source publish करना होगा?</th><th>Commercial use</th><th>Verdict</th></tr>
<tr><td>MIT / Apache-2.0 / BSD-2 / BSD-3 / Zlib / Unlicense / CC0</td><td>हाँ</td><td>नहीं</td><td>हाँ</td><td>सबसे आसान — सिर्फ credit/notice दो, launch कर दो</td></tr>
<tr><td>MPL-2.0</td><td>हाँ</td><td>सिर्फ modified files</td><td>हाँ</td><td>File-level copyleft — बाकी app closed रह सकती है</td></tr>
<tr><td>LGPL-2.1 / LGPL-3.0</td><td>हाँ (link)</td><td>सिर्फ library part</td><td>हाँ</td><td>Engine-based games के लिए ठीक</td></tr>
<tr><td>GPL-2.0 / GPL-3.0</td><td>हाँ</td><td><b>हाँ</b></td><td>हाँ</td><td>Modified game का source publish करना पड़ेगा</td></tr>
<tr><td>AGPL-3.0</td><td>हाँ</td><td><b>हाँ</b> (online play पर भी)</td><td>हाँ</td><td>सबसे strict — closed modification चाहिए तो avoid करो</td></tr>
<tr><td>CC-BY-4.0</td><td>हाँ</td><td>नहीं</td><td>हाँ (credit के साथ)</td><td>ज़्यादातर content/assets के लिए</td></tr>
</table>
<p><b>Play Store के लिए सबसे safe:</b> MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, Zlib, Unlicense, CC0 वाले games (CSV के <i>license</i> column से filter करें)।</p>

<h2>3. APK बनाने के तरीके</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Technology</th><th>APK Path</th></tr>
<tr><td>Java / Kotlin</td><td>Android Studio से directly build</td></tr>
<tr><td>C / C++</td><td>Android Studio + NDK/CMake (SDL games के ready Android ports हैं)</td></tr>
<tr><td>C#</td><td>Unity या Godot (C#) export</td></tr>
<tr><td>GDScript (Godot)</td><td>Godot Editor → Export → Android — one-click APK</td></tr>
<tr><td>Rust</td><td>cargo-ndk / aarch64-linux-android target</td></tr>
<tr><td>HTML5 / Web games</td><td>WebView wrapper · Capacitor/Cordova · PWA + TWA (Bubblewrap)</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>4. License Distribution (हर round में)</h2>
<h3>Round 1 — Native (600): MIT 258 · GPL-3.0 159 · Apache-2.0 78 · GPL-2.0 48 · AGPL-3.0 25 · LGPL-3.0 9 · BSD-3 8 · MPL-2.0 6 · LGPL-2.1 5 · Unlicense 4</h3>
<h3>Round 1 — Web (1000): MIT 679 · GPL-3.0 162 · AGPL-3.0 54 · Apache-2.0 53 · Unlicense 13 · BSD-3 13 · MPL-2.0 11 · GPL-2.0 11 · LGPL-2.1 4</h3>
<h3>Round 2 — Native (1638): MIT 894 · GPL-3.0 529 · Apache-2.0 100 · GPL-2.0 33 · zlib 26 · BSD-2 16 · CC0 15 · Unlicense 9 · AGPL 7 · MPL 6 · CC-BY 2 · BSD-3 1</h3>
<h3>Round 2 — Web (757): MIT 431 · GPL-3.0 162 · Apache 89 · CC0 15 · AGPL 15 · BSD-3 9 · Unlicense 9 · MPL 9 · GPL-2.0 10 · CC-BY 3 · BSD-2 4 · zlib 1</h3>
<p><b>Top languages:</b> Native — GDScript/Godot 448 · C++ 471 · C# 435 · Java 308 · Rust 250 · C 229 · Kotlin 65 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Web — JavaScript 1248 · TypeScript 194</p>

<h2>5. Duplicate Verification (Round 3 — 19 Oct 2026)</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Check</th><th>Result</th></tr>
<tr><td>Exact repo-URL duplicates</td><td><b>0</b> — कोई गेम repo level पर दोबारा नहीं आया</td></tr>
<tr><td>Normalized URL duplicates (case / .git / trailing slash)</td><td><b>0</b></td></tr>
<tr><td>Same normalized game-name clusters</td><td><b>79 clusters / 205 games</b></td></tr>
<tr><td>→ इनमें fork-suspects (identical repo name, different owner)</td><td><b>56 clusters / 146 games</b></td></tr>
<tr><td>Clone families (एक ही concept के independent implementations)</td><td><b>39 families / 750 entries</b></td></tr>
</table>
<p>• <b>recommended = BEST</b> वाली row = cluster का सबसे popular member — यही use करें।<br>
• <b>is_latest = yes</b> = सबसे नया update वाला version।<br>
• पूरी details: <a href="https://github.com/agentpocket0-gif/Reached/raw/main/data/duplicates_same_name.csv">duplicates_same_name.csv</a> · <a href="https://github.com/agentpocket0-gif/Reached/raw/main/data/clone_families.csv">clone_families.csv</a> · <a href="https://github.com/agentpocket0-gif/Reached/raw/main/data/verification_summary.json">verification_summary.json</a></p>
<h3>Notable confirmed duplicates / forks</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Cluster</th><th>Finding</th><th>Use करें (BEST)</th></tr>
<tr><td>space-station-14</td><td>space-wizards (main) vs space-syndicate (fork build)</td><td><a href="https://github.com/space-wizards/space-station-14">space-wizards/space-station-14</a> (3,870★)</td></tr>
<tr><td>wobble-rush-3d</td><td>code-yeongyu vs aayushman-singh — identical repo name</td><td><a href="https://github.com/code-yeongyu/wobble-rush-3d">code-yeongyu/wobble-rush-3d</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>vangers</td><td>KranX original vs kvark/vange-rs (Rust re-implementation)</td><td><a href="https://github.com/KranX/Vangers">KranX/Vangers</a> (739★)</td></tr>
<tr><td>PlantsVsZombies</td><td>3 अलग repos, same name</td><td><a href="https://github.com/limuy2022/PlantsVsZombies">limuy2022/PlantsVsZombies</a></td></tr>
</table>
<p>Clone families (duplicate नहीं, same concept): Snake (94) · Minecraft-style (70) · Chess (57) · Tetris (50) · Tic-tac-toe (48) · osu! (33) · Flappy (32) · Pong (30) · Minesweeper (27) · 2048 (26) · Doom (23) · Pacman (21) · Space Invaders (20) · Quake (18) · Breakout (18) · Pokemon (17) · Mario (17) · Wordle (15) · Asteroids (13) · Sudoku (11) — हर concept सिर्फ एक बार रखना हो तो BEST row pick करें।</p>

